 "is_vocab": false,
 "stimulus_html": "You  are about to roll a 20-sided die with faces labeled as follows: 5 faces have a 1, 6 faces have a 3, 4 faces have a 5, 3 faces have a 7, and 2 faces have a 9.",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 516343,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": " What is the expected value of the number showing on the die after it’s rolled?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "4.1"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Value</td>\n<td>Probability</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"n\\left( O \\right) \\times P\\left( O \\right)\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{5}{{20}}\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{5}{{20}}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{6}{{20}}\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{18}{{20}}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{4}{{20}}\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{20}{{20}}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{3}{{20}}\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{21}{{20}}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{2}{{20}}\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{18}{{20}}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>Sum</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{82}{{20}}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The sum of the numbers in the last column is the expected value = <span data-math=\"\\frac{{82}}{{20}} = \\frac{{41}}{{10}} = 4.1\"></span>.</p>"
    }
   ],
